// (29, 27), its warning light (30, 27, the script's RELAIS_VOYANT), the Tyranitarite's notch (28, 27) and
// the rubble over the bunker's trapdoor (31, 27). 2, L'Oasis (west, 4-19, 21-37): the dry lake round the
// violet pool (8-14, 27-32), joined to the hub by (20-23, 29-31). 3, La Centrale Morte (north-west): the
// yard (6-23, 9-15) under the plant's massif, its door (13, 8); the way down to the hub (24, 12-23) has gas
